# Treeguard Duo, ruling 2024-07-26: "The value of X is determined only as Treeguard Duo's triggered ability resolves, potentially including
# Treeguard Duo itself. It won't change later in the turn." Bot1 controls an Ornithopter and the Duo; the Duo's trigger targets itself, and
# in response Bot2 Lightning Bolts the Ornithopter, so X is 1 (the Duo alone): a 4/5 with vigilance, not the 5/6 it would be with X = 2.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Emerald
Mox Jet
Mox Pearl
Mox Ruby
Ornithopter
Treeguard Duo
Island x14

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Lightning Bolt
Island x18

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Emerald.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Emerald.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Treeguard Duo.Cast
Bot1.Target(Treeguard Duo)
Bot2.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Lightning Bolt.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Ornithopter)
[T3 Bot1.Main2]

[Expect]
Bot1.Graveyard = Ornithopter
Bot1.Battlefield.Treeguard Duo.Power = 4
Bot1.Battlefield.Treeguard Duo.Toughness = 5
Bot1.Battlefield.Treeguard Duo.Keywords = Vigilance
